                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Willis to Mr. Uhl.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Honolulu</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-06-03"><hi rendition="#italic">June 3,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. W. R. Castle commissioned to-day successor to Thurston.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Willis.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
